# Khabro branding

- The product name is **Khabro**. Use this exact capitalization in all reader-facing and admin-facing text, titles, manifests, and documentation.
- Use `khabro` for new slugs, storage keys, deep-link schemes, and non-secret product identifiers. Keep existing `@tazakhabar/*` package names and `TazaKhabar.*` .NET project/solution filenames unless a coordinated rename is planned. Do not introduce new `tazakhabar` or `newsfeed` names in user-facing copy.
- The reader is a calm, accessible interface for a 40+ audience with Light / Dark / System appearance. Primary blue fill is `#155EEF`; use saffron `#FFB000` sparingly for freshness or breaking-news signals, not routine primary controls. Both color schemes must keep WCAG AA contrast.
- Source brand assets from `apps/app/assets/khabro-app-icon.svg` and the exports documented in `docs/brand.md`. Do not introduce an alternate mark.
- Preserve 16px minimum body text, WCAG AA contrast, and 44px minimum tap targets when applying brand changes.
- Legacy `TazaKhabar.Api` / `NewsFeed.Api` namespaces and applied migrations are implementation history; do not rename or edit them solely for branding.
